      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "Perspective divides the picture by a leaning plane, so the checkerboard lies down into a floor whose far edge runs off to a horizon. The Translate before it slides the floor toward you one row a loop. Turn Tilt Y, or give it some Tilt X to bank the floor."
        }
      },
